Changelog v3.5.1.14:
  - [Security]: Added setting to prevent screenshots (active by default);
  - [Security]: Added permission to prevent overlays from other apps;
  - Invisible startup at boot;
  - minify restored for Release builds;
  - AndroidChart 5.3;
  - sqlcipher 4.18.0.

* SISIS: Update for public library Leipzig.
* New OPAC: public library Castrop-Rauxel,
public library Datteln,
public library Gladbeck,
public library Herten,
public library Oer-Erkenschwick,
Verbundbibliotheken Haltern, Marl and Recklinghausen.
* Arena OPAC: fix Freiburg reservations.

* Android: migrated to SDL3;
* Android: better detection of speech (TalkBack) state;
* built against the latest Re:instead;
* updated build system and dependencies.
